 {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "2089898914845162", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827286_2089898918178495_4497274503325493520_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f0UvYjvGovEQ7kNvwGkLI17&_nc_oc=AdlvqtFYGPyXJZmYDHOn-42El5l0ABikRIilysrZQSSrQj5DEivfZuGzoMtBrJaGA28&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs6PDYwxdvChhegSZXqs87IU8MCZp-Ctcc61OoD371TrA&oe=69A1A880"}, {"file_name": "7.png", "id": "682203651434927", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827720_682203654768260_1451577516060763779_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O4Qr0Auo79oQ7kNvwHvW20F&_nc_oc=AdnXbe3B2ipucy9h7a2Nk1gEGCUjsuA6p_15eMdbF3Heqqkv3dQC8BbwTUusD9uJWb8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv78kMXUdmvv0wy0WR8YTJSxz612msEQtX4uuWVJw0a8w&oe=69A1A599"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Space Lander", "keywords": ["Space", "Lunar", "Rocket", "scifi", "Landing"], "long_description": "Space Lander is a mixed reality landing game built where your real-world space becomes a landing site.\n\nYou\u2019ll start with a rocket booster that needs to land upright on a tower\u2014classic, clean, and surprisingly tough. Then there\u2019s the smaller spacecraft: quick, nimble, and built for weaving through tight spots and dodging floating debris before touching down.\n\nEach mission has a higher difficulty; every surface becomes part of the challenge. And with limited fuel, every second counts.\n\nIt\u2019s not about flashy explosions or over-the-top graphics. It\u2019s about control. Precision. The quiet tension of sticking the landing when it really counts.", "short_description": "Space Lander drops you into the pilot seat of rockets and ships, each with their own physics and challenges. It\u2019s you, gravity, and just enough fuel to make a safe landing."}]}, "developer_name": "RudyAA", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/spacelandervr/priva